            <AccessibilityItem>@L.T("头像兜底使用文字首字母，读屏软件可以直接朗读。", "Avatar fallbacks use text initials readable by screen readers")</AccessibilityItem>
                    <AccessibilityItem>@L.T("选择控件用 ItemLabel 作为无障碍名称。禁用的条目无法被选中；选择状态与条目模板里的可交互链接或按钮相互独立。", "Selection controls use ItemLabel for their accessible names. Disabled items cannot be selected; selection state is independent of interactive links or buttons in item templates.")</AccessibilityItem>
